<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="mission-intro">
    <p class="mission-label">OUR MISSION</p>
    <h1>
        A better choice for kitchens.
        A better future for communities.
    </h1>
    <p>
        We believe in bringing natural wooden products
        into everyday life while supporting craftsmanship
        and responsible choices.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="mission-split">
    <div class="mission-text">
        <h2>The plastic problem isn't just environmental.</h2>
        <p>
            Plastic has become part of our everyday kitchens.
            At Woodora, we believe that small changes can make
            a meaningful difference.
        </p>
        <p>
            We encourage choosing wooden kitchen tools as
            a natural alternative and making more thoughtful
            decisions in everyday life.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-image">
        <img src="/images/utensil-holder.jpeg" alt="Wooden kitchen utensils">
    </div>
</section>

<section class="craft-section">
    <div class="craft-heading">
        <h2>Craftsmanship with purpose</h2>
        <p>
            Every wooden piece represents creativity,
            care and attention to detail. We value
            handmade work and the people behind it.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="craft-image">
        <img src="/images/kitchen-tools.jpeg" alt="Wooden kitchen craftsmanship">
        <div class="craft-quote">
            "We don't just make utensils.
            We bring nature into your kitchen."
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mission-split community-section">
    <div class="mission-image">
        <img src="/images/kitchen-set.jpeg" alt="Wooden kitchen collection">
    </div>
    <div class="mission-text">
        <h2>Supporting people through craftsmanship</h2>
        <p>
            Behind every wooden product is a story of
            creativity, skill and hard work.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our mission is to appreciate traditional
            craftsmanship, create opportunities for
            local makers and encourage customers to
            value handmade products.
        </p>
        <a href="/impact" class="btn btn-gold">See Our Impact</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mission-vision">
    <p class="mission-label">OUR VISION</p>
    <h2>Our vision for the future</h2>
    <p>
        We imagine a world where every kitchen can
        welcome natural materials without sacrificing
        beauty, quality or functionality.

        We want every wooden piece to remind people
        that meaningful change begins with small choices.
    </p>
    <div class="button-row">
        <a href="/products" class="btn btn-gold">Shop the Collection</a>
        <a href="/impact" class="btn btn-outline-light">Discover Our Impact</a>
    </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
